      "scenes": [
        {
          "audio": "A medium-tempo, upbeat synth-pop track begins with a bright, energetic rhythm.",
          "label": "Opening Hook",
          "visual": "A white canvas displays a grid-like collage of animated and illustrated images. The collage features a young boy at a desk, a woman and child interaction, character concept art of men in traditional robes, a golden phoenix illustration, a fantasy landscape, and hands interacting with colorful physical buttons and a tablet. The camera is static. Lighting is bright and even. The color palette is vibrant and varied across the different images.",
