          "timestamp_start": "0:00"
        },
        {
          "audio": "The upbeat music continues. A male voice says in Chinese: 'These pictures...'",
          "label": "Product Selling Points",
          "visual": "A rapid zoom-in transition occurs into the collage, filling the screen with more instances of the same image types. A young boy (approximately 6-8 years old, light complexion, short black hair, wearing a dark blue shirt) is seen looking at a computer screen. To the right, a woman (approx. 30s, light complexion, brown hair tied back, wearing a green apron over a white shirt) leans over the same boy. The background is a blurry domestic interior with warm, soft lighting.",
          "shot_type": "Medium Shot",
          "scene_number": 2,
          "timestamp_end": "0:02",
          "timestamp_start": "0:01"
